, each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of ","type":"text"},{"code":"answers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as ","type":"text"},{"code":"respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" presents","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one, and sends it, which ends the session. A document left out","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isn’t in the response: the reader may ask for more than the holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shares. No document may be answered twice, nor one credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"answer two. Each holder key signs now, in the request’s order; a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeychainKeyStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" requiring user presence asks the holder once for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them all (","type":"text"},{"code":"KeychainKeyStore.Options.holderUserPresence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). On a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"WalletError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the prompt cancelled, say — nothing was sent and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the request stands: try again, or ","type":"text"},{"code":"decline","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderUserPresence":{"title":"holderUserPresence","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Require user presence (Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode) for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every signature with a holder key: to present a credential,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and to sign the Credential Request’s jwt proofs, so receiving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and refreshing credentials ask too — once per copy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"do